skinparam shadowing false
title U4-A1 · Dokumen baru (1): master data (D-209, I5)

|PPAP Engineer|
start
note right
  Sekali per customer atau model.
  Hak E-11, admin hanya melihat.
end note
:Daftarkan Project Group dan customer
(Customers, atau **Import customers and models**);
:Atur kolom **Signatures** customer:
Wet only atau Digital allowed (D-198),
dan **Customer submission** (D-207);
:Daftarkan group model, model,
dan part number (Models, D-42);
:Catat pemegang jabatan di **Positions**
(Project Leader, Project Engineer, NPI Manager,
QA QC Manager, D-54);
